<title>RUSSIA: Rostelekom plans additional rating.</title>
<headline>Rostelekom plans additional rating.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian long-distance telephone company Rostelekom plans to get another credit rating for its Eurobond issue, a senior company official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Last week Standard &amp; Poor's assigned Rostelekom BB-, which means stable outlook for the company.</p>
<p>AOOT Mezhdugorodnoi i Mezhdunarodnoi Elektricheskoi Svyazi Rostelekom plans to issue Eurobonds in 1997, and announce the terms of the issue in April.</p>
<p>--Olga Popova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
